- case: any compared to zero negates the result
  diagnostics:
    - code: RY107
      line: 194
      message: "`any()` returns a length-1 logical unless an `any`/`all` or `Summary`-group method dispatches, so this comparison is TRUE exactly when the call is FALSE (`NA` when it is `NA`); the comparison was probably meant for the elements: `any(lengths == 0)`"
      severity: warning
